    "Two-finger swipe up on notch to close, two-finger swipe down on notch to open when **Open notch on hover** option is disabled": {
      "comment": "A footer text explaining the gesture control functionality.",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "اسحب بإصبعين لأعلى على الشق للإغلاق، واسحب بإصبعين لأسفل على الشق لفتحه عند تعطيل خيار **فتح الشق عند التحويم**"
          }
        },
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Přejetím dvěma prsty nahoru po zářezu se okno zavře, přejetím dvěma prsty dolů po zářezu se okno otevře, pokud je možnost **Otevřít zářez při najetí** deaktivována."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zwei-Finger Wischen nach oben zum Schließen der Notch, zwei-Finger wischen nach unten um die Notch zu öffnen, wenn die Option **Notch bei Mausberührung öffnen** deaktiviert ist"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Two-finger swipe up on notch to close, two-finger swipe down on notch to open when **Open notch on hover** option is disabled"
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Two-finger swipe up on notch to close, two-finger swipe down on notch to open when **Open notch on hover** option is disabled"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deslizar con dos dedos hacia arriba en la muesca para cerrar, deslizar dos dedos hacia abajo en la muesca para abrir cuando la opción **Abrir muesca en el desplazamiento** está desactivada"
          }
        },
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": ""
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Glisser deux doigts vers le haut sur l'encoche pour la fermer, glisser deux doigts vers le bas sur l'encoche pour l'ouvrir lorsque l'option **Ouvrir l'encoche au survolant** est désactivée"
          }
        },
        "gu": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "જ્યારે **હોવર પર નોચ ખોલવાની** વિકલ્પ નિષ્ક્રિય હોય ત્યારે નોચ બંધ કરવા માટે નોચ પર બે-આંગળીથી ઉપર સ્વાઇપ કરો, નોચ ખોલવા માટે નોચ પર બે-આંગળીથી નીચે સ્વાઇપ કરો"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "जब **हॉवर पर नॉच खोलें** विकल्प अक्षम हो, तब नॉच बंद करने के लिए दो उंगलियों से नॉच पर ऊपर स्वाइप करें, नॉच खोलने के लिए दो उंगलियों से नॉच पर नीचे स्वाइप करें।"
          }
        },
        "hu": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Two-finger swipe up on notch to close, two-finger swipe down on notch to open when **Open notch on hover** option is disabled"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Scorri due dita verso l'alto sulla notch per chiudere, scorri due dita verso il basso sulla tacca per aprirla quando l'opzione **Apri notch all'hover ** è disabilitata"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "노치에 가져다 대서 열기 옵션이 꺼져있을 때, 노치를 두 손가락을 위로 밀어서 닫고, 두 손가락을 아래로 내려서 열기"
          }
        },
        "nb": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sveip opp med to fingre på hakket for å lukke, sveip ned med to fingre på hakket for å åpne når alternativet **Åpne hakket ved å holde musepekeren over** er deaktivert."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Przesuń dwoma palcami w górę na notchu, aby zamknąć, przesuń dwoma palcami w dół na notchu, aby otworzyć, gdy opcja **Otwórz notch przy najechaniu palcem ** jest wyłączona"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Two-finger swipe up on notch to close, two-finger swipe down on notch to open when **Open notch on hover** option is disabled"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Смахивание двумя пальцами вверх для закрытия, вниз для открытия, если отключено открытие при наведении."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": ""
          }
        },
        "ta": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**'மேல்வைக்கும்போது திற' விருப்பம்** முடக்கப்பட்டுள்ளபோது, நாட்சை மூட இரண்டு விரல்களால் மேல்நோக்கித் தட்டவும், திறக்க இரண்டு விரல்களால் கீழ்நோக்கித் தட்டவும்."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Two-finger swipe up on notch to close, two-finger swipe down on notch to open when **Open notch on hover** option is disabled"
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Проведіть двома пальцями вгору по виїмці, щоб закрити, проведіть двома пальцями вниз по виїмці, щоб відкрити, коли опція **Відкрити виїмку при наведенні курсору** вимкнена."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当**悬停时打开凹槽**选项关闭时，在凹槽处双指上滑关闭，双指下滑打开"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ปัดสองนิ้วขึ้นบนรอยบากเพื่อปิด ปัดสองนิ้วลงเพื่อเปิดเมื่อตัวเลือก **เปิดรอยบากเมื่อชี้** ถูกปิด"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Veeg met twee vingers omhoog over de inkeping om te sluiten, veeg met twee vingers omlaag over de inkeping om te openen wanneer de optie **Inkeping openen bij aanwijzen** is uitgeschakeld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
